# .env.example — template for offline / USB-bundle deployments.
#
# USAGE:
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # Edit .env and fill in real values.
#   # Optionally drop the target cluster's kubeconfig into this bundle:
#   #   scp user@master:/etc/kubernetes/admin.conf ./kubeconfig
#   # Then set KUBECONFIG=./kubeconfig below.
#
# SECURITY NOTE:
#   .env is listed in .gitignore and will NEVER be committed.
#   This bundle now carries credentials — treat the USB/directory as a secret:
#     - Store physically securely.
#     - Rotate tokens immediately after the demo.
#     - Delete .env (and kubeconfig, if bundled) once the session is done.
#
# LOADING:
#   Every entrypoint in this package sources lib/load-env.sh early.
#   lib/load-env.sh is a no-op when .env is absent, so users who do not
#   need .env are unaffected.

# ── Kubernetes cluster access ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Path to a kubeconfig file. May be absolute or relative to the package root.
# Relative form is useful when bundling a kubeconfig INSIDE this package:
#   KUBECONFIG=./kubeconfig
# If unset, kubectl uses its default (~/.kube/config).
# Uncomment + set only if you bundle a kubeconfig (leaving it set to a missing
# file would cause "kubeconfig not found" instead of falling back to ~/.kube/config).
# KUBECONFIG=./kubeconfig

# ── Target node override ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional: pin the target worker node for orchestration tests.
# If unset, the largest schedulable worker is auto-detected.
# TARGET_NODE=gpu-worker-01

# ── GitHub token ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal Access Token with repo + workflow scopes.
# Required for: 02-run-gitops.sh --drive, 01-gitops-preflight.sh GitHub API checks.
# Alternative: store in ~/.git-credentials (https://user:TOKEN@github.com).
# GITHUB_USER is also required by 00-install/03-setup-git-push.sh — without it the
# script still prompts for the username (the token prompt is skipped when set here).
# GITHUB_USER=REPLACE_ME
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_REPLACE_ME

# ── Docker Hub credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by 02-setup-credentials.sh to create an imagePullSecret in the cluster.
# DOCKERHUB_USER=REPLACE_ME
# DOCKERHUB_TOKEN=dckr_pat_REPLACE_ME

# ── ArgoCD Git-repo credential ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by 02-setup-credentials.sh to create an ArgoCD repository Secret.
# GIT_REPO_URL=https://github.com/KETI-AI-Storage/ai-storage-platform
# GIT_USERNAME=REPLACE_ME
# GIT_TOKEN=ghp_REPLACE_ME

# ── GitOps stage configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Defaults shown — override only when your environment differs.
# MONOREPO=/tmp/ai-storage-platform
# REPO=KETI-AI-Storage/ai-storage-platform
# BRANCH=cicd-automation
# REG=ketidevit2
